{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Agent OS API",
    "description": "# Agent OS API\n\nAgent OS 后端 API 服务，提供以下功能：\n\n- **认证**: 登录、注册、令牌管理\n- **线程**: 会话线程 CRUD 与消息查询\n- **Agent 配置**: Agent 配置查询与筛选\n- **任务**: 任务 CRUD、提交、评估\n- **工具**: 工具注册查询\n- **记忆**: 记忆检索与管理\n- **评估指标**: 指标定义查询\n- **插件热重载**: 插件状态与重载\n\n## 认证方式\n\n所有受保护接口使用 Bearer Token 认证：\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\n```\n\n或通过 query 参数传递：\n\n```\n?token=<access_token>\n```\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "认证"
        ],
        "summary": "用户登录",
        "description": "验证用户名密码，返回 access token 和 refresh token。\n\nArgs:\n    request: 登录请求，包含用户名和密码\n\nReturns:\n    TokenResponse 包含 access_token 和 refresh_token\n\nRaises:\n    HTTPException: 用户名或密码错误",
        "operationId": "login_api_v1_auth_login_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/auth/register": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "认证"
        ],
        "summary": "用户注册",
        "description": "创建新用户并返回 token。\n\nArgs:\n    request: 注册请求，包含用户名、密码和可选邮箱\n\nReturns:\n    TokenResponse 包含 access_token 和 refresh_token\n\nRaises:\n    HTTPException: 用户名已存在",
        "operationId": "register_api_v1_auth_register_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegisterRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/auth/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "认证"
        ],
        "summary": "获取当前用户信息",
        "description": "通过 Bearer token 获取当前用户信息。\n\n支持 Authorization: Bearer <token> 头和 ?token= query 参数。\n\nArgs:\n    authorization: Authorization 请求头\n    token: Query 参数中的 token（备选）\n\nReturns:\n    UserResponse 用户信息\n\nRaises:\n    HTTPException: token 无效",
        "operationId": "get_me_api_v1_auth_me_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "token",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Token"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "authorization",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Authorization"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/auth/refresh": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "认证"
        ],
        "summary": "刷新令牌",
        "description": "使用 refresh token 获取新的 access token。\n\n支持 Authorization 头和 query 参数。\n\nArgs:\n    authorization: Authorization 请求头\n    token: Query 参数中的 refresh token\n\nReturns:\n    TokenResponse 新的 token 对\n\nRaises:\n    HTTPException: refresh token 无效或已撤销",
        "operationId": "refresh_token_api_v1_auth_refre